{"id":"detective","lemma":"detective","pos":"noun","rank":609,"glosses":["detective"],"ipa":"/deteɡˈtibe/","gender":"mf","forms":{"plural":"detectives","feminine":"detective","femininePlural":"detectives"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f6/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-detective.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él contrató a un detective privado.","en":"He hired a private investigator.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645535"},{"text":"Dos detectives persiguieron al sospechoso.","en":"Two detectives followed the suspect.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/527108"},{"text":"Tom piensa que está siendo seguido por un detective privado.","en":"Tom thinks he's being shadowed by a private detective.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/805938"},{"text":"Los detectives estaban desorientados.","en":"The detectives were baffled."},{"text":"Tom contrató a un detective.","en":"Tom hired a detective."}]}